  "title": "Cinnamon Sugar Pumpkin Seeds",
  "description": "These toasted cinnamon sugar pumpkin seeds are sweet, buttery, and so easy to make with fresh pumpkin seeds when you clean your pumpkins for carving.",
  "authors": [
